{"reviewId": "254632126_86dQX6ake", "review": {"abstract": "一个人在60年人生的主要阶段中，有30年会参与经济生活，这30年里康波给予你的财富机会只有三次，不以你的主观意志为转移。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "18 演讲实录：人生就是一场康波", "chapterUid": 23, "content": "我的第一个机会是炒股有盈利，在924最好的时间中签新股，这个机会被我抓住了。下一个机会应该是下一份工作跳槽，经验丰富后base会增加。至于第三个机会我还没看到，不会是嫁入豪门吧。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "4062-4122", "createTime": 1768637448, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 23, "reviewId": "254632126_86dQX6ake", "userVid": 254632126, "topics": [], "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "18 演讲实录：人生就是一场康波", "author": {"userVid": 254632126, "name": "永", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0025-32E0OFhx5chquLfRm0XQGe7/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "不求甚解", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "肖李", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-2000", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 2000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 2, "likes": [{"userVid": 439940589, "name": "飘", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0003-MN050ybswvrysqjBPvubIfb/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M1-0-90", "desc": "连续阅读", "title": "连续阅读", "levelIndex": 90}}], "commentsCount": 4, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"reviewId": "254632126_86dQX6ake", "content": "结婚也是改变命运的方式之一", "c